- Dependent sections: `.edminboost-cc-section.is-disabled`, `.edminboost-dependent-section.is-disabled` (opacity + pointer-events off + `user-select: none`; White Label uses `.edminboost-cc-section`; Security login redirects, dashboard widgets, and admin footer use `.edminboost-dependent-section` on `#edminboost-login-redirects-options`, `#edminboost-dashboard-widgets-options`, and `#edminboost-admin-footer-options`).
