- Settings form: `.edminboost-fieldset`, `.edminboost-checkbox-row`, `.edminboost-checkbox-grid`, `.edminboost-select-rows` (+ `.edminboost-select-row` two-column label/select grid for grouped dropdowns such as Heartbeat control).
