## Mapper JS (`initMapper`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-mapper-form`, `#edminboost-topbar-items`, `#edminboost-topbar-canvas`, `#edminboost-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`, `#edminboost-item-drawer`, `#edminboost-plugin-search`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview-wrap`.

- Canvas items: drag-reorder within canvas (`dragItem`, `effectAllowed: move`); keyed by `data-slug` + `data-anchor`.
- Discovered rows: drag-to-canvas (`dragPayload`, `effectAllowed: copy`); checkbox and row-click toggle add/remove (skipped when anchor is set).
- `setDiscoveredChecked()` keeps discovered `is-active` in sync with canvas membership for non-anchored slugs only.
- `syncHiddenInputs()` writes indexed hidden fields for `top_bar_items` (including `anchor`) before form submit.
- Custom link fields: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor`; path may include `#fragment`.
- Item drawer field: `#edminboost-item-anchor`; preview button `#edminboost-drawer-preview` POSTs to `edminboost_cc_drawer_preview`, then calls `edminboostCcOpenDrawer`.
- Hidden marker input: `command_center[_layout_studio_save]` = `1` (Layout Studio partial only).
- Plugin search (`#edminboost-plugin-search`): filters discovered rows by visible label text.

## Behavior JS (`initBehavior`)

Runs on Appearance page (`#edminboost-appearance-form`). Key elements: `input[name*="[badge_style]"]`, `.edminboost-badge-preview__item`, `input[name*="[drawer_width]"]`, `#edminboost-drawer-width-custom`, `#edminboost_drawer_width_custom`, `#edminboost_drawer_width_preview_drawer`, `#edminboost-drawer-width-preview-caption`.

- Badge preview: shows one `.edminboost-badge-preview__item` matching the selected `badge_style` radio.
- Custom drawer width: toggles `#edminboost-drawer-width-custom` when `drawer_width=custom`; slider updates px label and preview drawer width (% of 1280px reference viewport); caption uses `edminboostData.strings.drawerWidthPreviewCaption`.
- Animation speed: screen-reader `#edminboost_animation_speed` stays the form source of truth; `#edminboost_animation_speed_toggle` opens `#edminboost-animation-speed-list` (listbox); option click updates select + plays toggle drawer preview; list open staggers `.edminboost-animation-speed-picker__preview-drawer` demos; Escape closes list.

## CC tab navigation JS (`initCommandCenterNav`)

- Intercepts `.edminboost-cc-nav__link` inside `.edminboost-wrap` (skips modified clicks / `_blank`).
- If `pendingDashboardOverviewSave` is set, waits for that Promise before loading the next tab (`loadCommandCenterPageNow`).
- POSTs `page` to `edminboostData.ccNav` (`edminboost_load_cc_page`); replaces `.edminboost-wrap` with parsed response HTML.
- Updates `document.title`, `edminboostData.currentPage`, and `history.pushState` / `popstate`; calls `reinitEdminboostPage()`.
- Nav links use `data-edminboost-page` + `href`; loading state on `.edminboost-cc-nav` (`is-loading`, `aria-busy`) and wrap (`is-cc-loading`).
- Falls back to `window.location.assign( url )` on fetch failure.

## Layout preset picker JS (`initLayoutPresetPicker`)

Key elements: `#edminboost_layout_preset`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-picker`, `#edminboost_layout_preset_toggle`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-list`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-name`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-badge`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-desc`, `.edminboost-preset-picker .edminboost-overview-topbar-preview`, `.edminboost-preset-picker .edminboost-overview-sidebar-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-sidebar-preview`.

- Custom listbox mirrors theme preset picker UX; options grouped by `edminboostData.presetCategories`.
- `renderTopBarPreview( presetId )` rebuilds embedded mini admin bar (max 4 links + overflow) from resolved preset `top_bar_items`; icon tips use `createTopBarPreviewTip()` / overflow uses `appendTopBarPreviewTooltip()` (accessible tooltip spans, not `title`).
- `renderSidebarPreview( presetId )` rebuilds `.edminboost-overview-sidebar-preview` from preset `sidebar_items` (max 5 + overflow).
- `syncPresetCatalogFn` rebuilds grouped options when AJAX save returns refreshed `presets`.
- Used on setup wizard step 1, Layout Presets page, and Dashboard overview (`preset_picker_mode === 'overview'`); Presets page apply/duplicate/export stays in `initPresets`.

## Dashboard overview JS (`initDashboardOverview`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-dashboard-overview-form`, `#edminboost_dashboard_apply_preset`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-list`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-list`, `#edminboost-overview-topbar-links-picker`, `#edminboost_overview_topbar_links_toggle`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-sidebar-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-theme-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-topbar-preview`.

- Layout preset option click sets `_apply_preset` hidden field and AJAX-saves; success reloads the page (preset apply).
- Theme preset option click updates `edminboostData.themeSettings.preset`, syncs hidden `#edminboost_theme_preset`, calls `syncThemeSettingsFn()` (live body preview via `initTheme`), updates `#edminboost-overview-theme-preview` swatches, and AJAX-saves with `{ silent: true }`.
- `saveDashboardOverview()` returns a Promise, queues concurrent saves via `pendingDashboardOverviewSave`, and syncs `#edminboost_theme_preset` from `edminboostData.themeSettings` before submit.
- Read-only top bar links picker toggles `#edminboost-overview-topbar-links-list` (closes on scroll via `initPickerCloseOnScroll`).

## Setup wizard JS (`initSetupWizard`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-setup-wizard-form`, `.edminboost-setup-stepper__item`, `.edminboost-setup-step`, `#edminboost-setup-back`, `#edminboost-setup-next`, `#edminboost-setup-submit`, `#edminboost_wizard_apply_preset`, `#edminboost_wizard_default_preset`, `.edminboost-wizard-preset-radio`, `#edminboost-wizard-topbar-summary`.

- Four-step stepper toggles visible panels; Back/Next/Submit footer controls step navigation.
- Layout preset selection updates hidden `_apply_preset` / `default_preset` and re-renders top bar summary from `edminboostData.presets`.
- Final submit uses marker `command_center[_setup_wizard_save]` = `1` (sets `onboarding_completed` server-side when top bar items are saved).

## Dependent section toggles (`syncDependentSection`, `initWhiteLabel`, `initSecurityFeatures`, `initProductivityFeatures`)

Shared helper `syncDependentSection( section, isEnabled )` applies the master-toggle pattern: add `.is-disabled` + `aria-disabled="true"` on the section wrapper; set `tabindex="-1"` / `aria-disabled="true"` on nested `input`, `textarea`, `select`, `button`, and `a[href]` controls (store prior `tabindex` in `data-edminboost-dependent-tabindex` and restore when re-enabled). Used by Security login redirects and Productivity dashboard widgets / admin footer.

### White Label (`initWhiteLabel`)

Key elements: `#edminboost_wl_enabled`, `#edminboost-wl-status-section`, `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-section`, `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-preview`, `#edminboost_wl_plugin_name`, `#edminboost_wl_plugin_description`, `#edminboost_wl_plugin_author`, `#edminboost_wl_plugin_uri`, `#edminboost_wl_menu_label`, `#edminboost-wl-preview-name`, `#edminboost-wl-preview-description`, `#edminboost-wl-preview-author-link`, `#edminboost-wl-preview-menu-label`.

- Master toggle disables `.edminboost-cc-section` dependents (`#edminboost-wl-status-section`, `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-section`).
- Live preview reads empty fields from `#edminboost-wl-rebrand-preview` `data-default-*` attributes (server defaults from `EDMINBOOST_White_Label::get_plugin_header_defaults()`).
- Author link uses `#` + `tabindex="-1"` when URI is empty; `click` prevented when no URI.

### Security login redirects (`initSecurityFeatures`)

Key elements: `#edminboost_login_redirects_enabled`, `#edminboost-login-redirects-options` (`.edminboost-dependent-section`).

- Master toggle disables redirect URL fields (default login/logout + per-role URLs) when login redirects are off.
- Server-rendered initial state mirrors toggle (`is-disabled` + `aria-disabled` on `#edminboost-login-redirects-options` in `edminboost-feature-fields.php`).

### Productivity dependents + live preview (`initProductivityFeatures`)

Key elements: `#edminboost_dashboard_widgets_enabled`, `#edminboost-dashboard-widgets-options`; `#edminboost_admin_footer_enabled`, `#edminboost-admin-footer-options` (both `.edminboost-dependent-section`); `#edminboost-productivity-admin-notices-preview` (+ `#edminboost_hide_admin_notices`, `#edminboost_hide_screen_help`; items `[data-preview]`).

- Dashboard widgets master toggle disables per-widget checkboxes when off; admin footer master toggle disables the custom text field when off.
- Admin notices preview: removable items sync via shared `syncPerformancePreviewItem()` when matching toggle is checked; non-removable items (error/warning notices) stay visible.
- Server-rendered initial state mirrors each toggle in `edminboost-feature-fields.php` and saved settings in `edminboost-productivity-preview.php`.

### Performance live previews (`initPerformanceFeatures`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-performance-emoji-preview` (+ `#edminboost_disable_emojis_enabled`, `#edminboost_disable_emojis_scope`; panels `[data-scope]`); `#edminboost-performance-assets-preview` (+ `#edminboost_remove_asset_versions`, `#edminboost_remove_dashicons_frontend`, `#edminboost_disable_embeds`; items `[data-preview]`).

- Shared helper `syncPerformancePreviewItem( item, isRemoved )` toggles `.is-removed`, updates `aria-label`, and syncs child `.edminboost-performance-preview__tooltip` from `data-tooltip-loaded` / `data-tooltip-removed`.
- Emoji preview: active panel + removed items when toggle on and scope matches (`admin`, `frontend`, or `both`).
- Assets preview: each item reflects its matching checkbox (`remove_asset_versions`, `remove_dashicons_frontend`, `disable_embeds`).
- Server-rendered initial state mirrors saved settings in `edminboost-performance-preview.php`.

## Theme JS (`initTheme`)

Key elements: hidden `#edminboost_theme_preset`, custom listbox `#edminboost-theme-preset-picker` (+ `#edminboost_theme_preset_toggle`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-list`), `#edminboost_theme_mode`, `#edminboost_theme_font`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-desc`, `#edminboost-theme-custom-colors`, `#edminboost-theme-preview`, custom fields `#edminboost_custom_{accent|surface|text|top|sidebar}` + matching `*_picker` inputs.

- Preset listbox toggles custom color pickers (`preset === 'custom'`); updates toggle swatches and description from `edminboostData.themePresets`.
- `#edminboost_theme_preset` `change` listener runs `updateThemePreview()` (including Dashboard overview when the hidden select is synced from the overview theme picker).
- Exposes `syncThemeSettingsFn( themeSettings )` — syncs preset/mode/font/custom color fields then calls `updateThemePreview()`; bootstraps from `edminboostData.themeSettings` when preset differs from the hidden select.
- Live preview applies body classes (`edminboost-theme--*`, `edminboost-theme-mode--*`, `edminboost-theme-font--*`) and inline `--eb-*` vars on `document.body` and `#edminboost-theme-preview`.
- Color picker ↔ hex text sync; invalid hex leaves preview unchanged until valid.

## AJAX save (`initCommandCenterForms` / `initSettingsForm`)

- Intercepts `.edminboost-cc-form` and `.edminboost-settings-form` submit; POSTs `FormData` to `edminboostData.settingsSave.ajaxUrl` with action `edminboost_save_settings`.
- Strips `action` from `FormData` first (`settings_fields()` adds `update` for options.php) before appending the plugin AJAX action.
- `saveSettingsForm( form, options )` returns a `Promise`; options: `reload`, `silent` (skip success notice), `message`, `onSuccess`.
- Uses nonce from form (`settings_fields()`); shows inline success/error notice unless `silent`; optional reload via `{ reload: true }`.
- Success payload may include `presets`, `selected_preset`, `active_layout_preset`, `default_preset`, `theme`, `setup_complete`, `message` — `applySettingsSaveResult()` syncs `edminboostData.presets` (and `syncPresetCatalogFn` when `active_layout_preset` or `selected_preset` is set), updates `edminboostData.themeSettings` + calls `syncThemeSettingsFn` on non-dashboard forms, and reloads Dashboard via CC nav when wizard completes.

## Backup/import JS (`initBackupSettings`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-backup-section`, `#edminboost-export-settings`, `#edminboost-import-settings`, `#edminboost-import-method-paste` / `#edminboost-import-method-file`, `#edminboost-import-paste-panel`, `#edminboost-import-file-panel`, `#edminboost-import-json`, `#edminboost-import-file`.

- Export POSTs to `edminboost_export_settings` and downloads `export-YYYY-MM-DD.json`.
- Import reads pasted JSON or a selected `.json` file (`FileReader`), POSTs to `edminboost_import_settings`, reloads on success; errors use `window.alert()`.
- Paste vs file panels toggle via CSS `:has( #edminboost-import-method-paste:checked )` on `#edminboost-backup-section` (no extra JS).

## Presets page JS (`initPresets` / `initRoleMatrix`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-presets-form`, `.edminboost-role-matrix`, `.edminboost-role-preset-select`, `.edminboost-role-matrix__check input[type="checkbox"]`.

- `initRoleMatrix()` syncs visibility checkboxes when assigned preset changes; uses `edminboostData.roleMatrix` and preset `visible_top_level_menu_slugs`.
- Protected slugs stay checked/disabled; items outside preset get `.is-not-in-layout` and start unchecked on preset change.
- Apply/duplicate/save/export preset actions remain in `initPresets`.

